      "primaryMeaning": "Golden Yasmin itself describes its named Tabarka residence as accommodation with thirty equipped apartments, visitor services and resort activities. The source polygon links that same operator property URL and carries its contacts and four-star marker. This is strong named-property identity evidence, not a legal boundary certification.",
      "sourceHistoryMeaning": "The way begins as tourism=chalet in 2011, changes to leisure=resort in 2017, then becomes landuse=residential in version13 in September2025 while preserving the operator contacts and website. All fourteen versions concern the same named tourism property; no version establishes a neighborhood boundary.",
      "qualification": "The official tourism portal entry calls it an appart-hotel, but visibly marks its submission anonymous and unverified. It is supplementary, not proof of licensing, current certification or ownership. The separate main-hotel map pin does not certify this residential-property entrance or footprint."
    },
