      "primaryMeaning": "A public property advertiser offers a holiday apartment at the second floor of Residence Bel Horizon in the Tabarka tourist zone. This is independently attributable property-use evidence, not municipal, ownership or cadastral certification. No advertiser or occupant identity is needed or reproduced in this conclusion.",
      "sourceHistoryMeaning": "All three authentic way versions consistently designate landuse=residential with residential=apartments. The first is a named apartment-complex object; later versions preserve that role and add language tags. Its full current topology matches exactly the 19-vertex original PBF ring and all164packed bytes.",
      "qualification": "Google name search has two separate similarly named pins. No merger or equivalence between them is proposed. The coordinate observation supports a building/residential-complex scale only. The proposed action concerns this exact source apartment-complex polygon, not every place using Bel Horizon in its name."
    }
